title: DnD
---
Sprout: No way- limited edition Dungeons, Dragons and Deepshit dice! Bet I can D20 my life!
Roll dice?
-> Yes
    <<if dice(2) == 1>>
        Critical fail. At least the only monsters here are the ones in our head...and the floor.
    <<else>>
        Critical success! Seducing those goblins was a piece of cake. If only that charisma extended to our real love life.
    <<endif>>
-> No
    Can't lose if you never play...or win?
Sprout: I know more about this game now than I did then.
