title: Notebook
---
* It's a mini notebook. It reads, "group orgy!". There are doodles of stars, swords, and VERY cursed stick figures.
Open?
-> Yes
    "Is it already crackhead hours? It's only five in the morning."
-> No
    <<jump NotebookEnd>>
Read another?
-> Yes
    "D&D&D SUNDAY?! (ง︡'-'︠)ง YALL BETTER PULL UPPP OR I SWEAR IM MAKING YALL FIGHT A SENTIENT CHAIR AGAIN1!1!1!"
-> No
    <<jump NotebookEnd>>
Read another?
-> Keep reading like a little gremlin
    "I swear if the password is just ‘password,’ I’m going to lose my shit. :'D" - Sunni
    A later entry, in fine writing reads, “It’s uncrackable. No one would think to try it.”
    Another, in scribbly writing reads, “yea sprout. thats why u keep getting hacked. :P” - Sunni
    Another, even later entry. “Why do you keep signing off on your own entries, cybertech security?”
-> Close it before you start summoning the chair spirits.
    <<jump NotebookEnd>>
Read another?
-> Keep reading because you’re too far in the trenches to go back now
    Quote \#696 "look at their sadness, it's so attractive. :0"
-> Absolutely not
    <<jump NotebookEnd>>
Read another?
-> Slowly descend to further madness as you keep reading this cursed journal
    "Is that not what friendship is?" and another, later entry, "CoErCiOn??!!"
-> Put the book down to regain your sanity
    <<jump NotebookEnd>>
Read another?
-> Does this actually have an end?
    There is atrocious handwriting, it's barely legible. "hey, i love u guys. i'm always gonna b here. thank u for being who u r and where u r."
-> Dear god let it be over
    <<jump NotebookEnd>>
